  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the United Nations Association of Norway from 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the United Nations Association of Norway&apos;s  strategic plan. Priority efforts aimed at promoting increased support for the UN and trust in the UN&apos;s solutions in response to the crises the world is facing. The work is mainly aimed at children and young people in the school system, but the United Nations Association of Norway will also contribute to public debate.</narrative>
  </description>
